{
  "about": "The owner-draft model's key table (spec 2026-11-24-workchat-polish §6.1): each case feeds its keys, one owner input chunk each, into an empty draft under its profile, and expects the model after the last one. Read by Go TestDraftFixture (internal/sessionhost/prompt_state_test.go) and Swift DraftModelFixtureTests (WatchtowerDesktop/Tests/Core): one rule on both sides, and FakeHostDelivery uses the Swift model.",
  "claude_code_checked": "Claude Code 2.1.331, by hand in a pty on 2026-11-24: idle, one Ctrl+C over typed text cleared the input but showed 'Press Ctrl-C again to exit' (exit armed); working, one Ctrl+C interrupted the turn ('Interrupted · What should Claude do instead?') and the typed text stayed in the prompt. Neither just clears the input, so spec C11 applies: the owner's Ctrl+C makes the draft inexact for every profile.",
  "cases": [
    {"name": "type-abc", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["a", "b", "c"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 3, "exact": true, "holds": true}},
    {"name": "type-then-backspace-all", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["a", "b", "c", "\u007f", "\u007f", "\u007f"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 0, "exact": true, "holds": false}},
    {"name": "backspace-on-empty", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["\u007f"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 0, "exact": true, "holds": false}},
    {"name": "ctrl-h-backspace", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["a", "\b"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 0, "exact": true, "holds": false}},
    {"name": "typed-fast-in-one-chunk", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["abc\u007f"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 2, "exact": true, "holds": true}},
    {"name": "ctrl-u-single-line", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["h", "i", "\u0015"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 0, "exact": true, "holds": false}},
    {"name": "ctrl-u-multi-line", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["a", "\n", "b", "\u0015"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 2, "exact": false, "holds": true}},
    {"name": "backslash-return-line-break", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["a", "\\", "\r"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 2, "exact": false, "holds": true}},
    {"name": "option-return-line-break", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["a", "\u001b\r"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 1, "exact": false, "holds": true}},
    {"name": "left-then-backspace-all", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["a", "b", "\u001b[D", "\u007f", "\u007f"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 2, "exact": false, "holds": true}},
    {"name": "ctrl-a", "profile": "claude", "keys": ["a", "\u0001"], "dialog": false,
     "expect": {"count": 1, "exact": false, "holds": true}},
